{
  "_doc": "Mage level-up pool. kind skill = an attack the run uses; stat = a modifier. effects apply per level: add (flat) or mul (+fraction). weight = roll weight. skills.<id>.cast says how the run casts it: nearest (burst cast_range px toward the nearest monster), self (burst on the hero), random (count[level-1] bursts on random monsters within cast_range), wave (anim_prefix + direction, flies at speed px/s through monsters, count[level-1] directions: nearest, opposite, then the two others), active (player-triggered: the dash; sprite = the hero, anim = its animation). tier_sprites pick the sprite by level. under_hero = the effect is drawn behind the hero (ground effects around it, e.g. the stomp). on_hit = statuses the skill puts on monsters it hits (assets/data/statuses.json), each from a skill level. projectile = flies at speed px/s for duration s toward the nearest monster (count fan out 12 deg); it hits when its fly hitbox (from the sprite) touches a monster: explode = the impact animation hitbox deals the damage, else the fly hitbox does and it pierces pierce more monsters; impact = its hit animation. icon = borrow another card icon.",
